# POC-VMS-32/33/35 live runner audit

- [ ] Gold and expected files never enter a Devin workspace.
- [ ] Three roles receive independent frozen component inputs.
- [ ] Each role has exactly one attempt and retry_count=0.
- [ ] The requested sandbox profile and exact frozen fixture manifest are recorded; sandbox/no-sandbox results are never pooled.
- [ ] The Devin process exits before the bundle is sealed, and export JSON plus exact DONE grammar are checked separately.
- [ ] Event extraction scoring verifies raw byte spans, revisit identity, typed edges, and two-parent merge.
- [ ] Normalizer scoring checks immutable history and only three preregistered corrections.
- [ ] Auditor scoring expects the mixed candidate set to fail overall and rejects the fake merge.
- [ ] Result keeps production, streaming, Codex, Solver, Tell/Hint, and cross-domain claims NOT PROVEN.
